# Local development broker. On the VPS each login is narrower (probe-device
# may only use probe/req/probe-device, probe/res/probe-device, probe/events/#
# and probe/status/#); here both may use probe/#, because the integration
# tests give every test its own topic prefix (probe/it-<random>).
user probe-app
topic readwrite probe/#

# A device (like the LTE modem probe), used by the integration tests.
user probe-device
topic readwrite probe/#
